{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-predictive-clv","title":"历史 CLV 与预测 CLV","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/clv-modeling/historical-predictive-clv","wordCount":3109,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"历史-clv-与预测-clv\">历史 CLV 与预测 CLV</h1><p>「这个客户值多少钱」在同一个会议室里至少有四种答案，而大部分 CLV 项目的失败不是模型不准，是四种答案被混着用：财务要的是已经发生的收入确认，投放要的是未来还会贡献多少，采购要的是扣掉所有成本后的净额，而战略要的是折算到今天之后能拿来做横向比较的那个数。本文先把这四个答案之间的关系钉死，再分别给出可实现的公式、各自的适用边界，以及跨境场景下最容易踩空的那几个地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-clv-是四个不同问题的四个答案\">核心概念：CLV 是四个不同问题的四个答案</h2><p>把 CLV 当成一个数而不是一个概念，是绝大多数误用的起点。下面这张表把四个答案的差别、计算方式与典型用途分开，它们是四个独立的量，不是同一个量的四种精度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>名字</th>\n<th>计算输入</th>\n<th>时间方向</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>用错时的症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>追溯</td>\n<td>历史 CLV (historic CLV)</td>\n<td>已发生的累计贡献边际</td>\n<td>过去</td>\n<td>客户分层标签、模型目标变量</td>\n<td>用它出价 → 只买得起最便宜的量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入确认</td>\n<td>累计收入 (cumulative revenue)</td>\n<td>已发生 GMV</td>\n<td>过去</td>\n<td>财务对账</td>\n<td>与利润脱钩，退货多的市场虚高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前瞻</td>\n<td>预测 CLV (predicted CLV)</td>\n<td>模型估计的未来贡献</td>\n<td>未来</td>\n<td>出价上限、预算分配</td>\n<td>无区间 → 决策无法承受误差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前瞻+折扣</td>\n<td>折现 CLV (discounted CLV)</td>\n<td>未来贡献按折现率折现</td>\n<td>未来</td>\n<td>跨客户/跨市场横向比较</td>\n<td>不给折现率 → 长期收益被高估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个量里，<strong>历史 CLV 是唯一可以被精确计算出来的</strong>，因为它只依赖已经发生的事实。这一点很重要：它是所有预测模型的标签来源，也是唯一可以作为「事实依据」在争议中使用的数。预测 CLV 则永远带着模型依赖——换一个模型，同一个人的值就变了，所以它必须带不确定性区间，否则下游无法判断该不该为这个估计采取行动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单与退货事件流] --&gt; B[贡献边际归集]&#10;  B --&gt; C[历史 CLV]&#10;  C --&gt; D{用途分流}&#10;  D --&gt;|作为监督学习标签| E[预测 CLV 模型]&#10;  D --&gt;|客户分层| F[行为分群]&#10;  E --&gt; G[带区间的未来价值估计]&#10;  G --&gt; H[折现 CLV]&#10;  C --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[获客出价上限 / 预算分配]\">graph TD\n  A[订单与退货事件流] --&gt; B[贡献边际归集]\n  B --&gt; C[历史 CLV]\n  C --&gt; D{用途分流}\n  D --&gt;|作为监督学习标签| E[预测 CLV 模型]\n  D --&gt;|客户分层| F[行为分群]\n  E --&gt; G[带区间的未来价值估计]\n  G --&gt; H[折现 CLV]\n  C --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[获客出价上限 / 预算分配]</pre><p>上图的要点是分流发生在历史 CLV 之后：同一份历史事实既当标签又当分层依据，而预测路径必须回到折现这一步才能和横向量比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"历史-clv-的精确公式与三个变体\">历史 CLV 的精确公式与三个变体</h2><p>历史 CLV 的定义是「该客户截至今天为止，为平台带来的累计贡献边际」。写成求和形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CLV</mtext><mtext>hist</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>COGS</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>shipping</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>returns</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>payment fee</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLV}_{\\text{hist}}(i) = \\sum_{t \\in T_i} \\big( \\text{GMV}_{i,t} - \\text{COGS}_{i,t} - \\text{shipping}_{i,t} - \\text{returns}_{i,t} - \\text{payment fee}_{i,t} \\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4444em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COGS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipping</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">returns</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payment fee</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是客户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的全部成交时刻集合。注意这里用的是<strong>贡献边际</strong>而不是毛利：发货成本与支付手续费在多市场之间差异巨大（同样的商品卖到巴西和卖到日本，履约成本可以差三倍），把它们放在公式外面会让跨市场比较彻底失真。</p>\n<p><strong>变体一：含量化时间窗的截断 CLV。</strong> 当客户生命周期很长而观测期有限时，需要截断：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>CLV</mtext><mtext>hist</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mtext>margin</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLV}_{\\text{hist}}^{[0,T]}(i) = \\sum_{t \\in T_i,\\, t \\le T} \\text{margin}_{i,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hist</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">margin</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是建模时最常用的形式，因为监督学习的每个样本必须在一个统一的观测窗口内计算，否则新注册客户的标签会系统性偏小。</p>\n<p><strong>变体二：平均单次贡献 × 次数。</strong> 当事件明细丢失、只有汇总结算数据时，只能用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{m}_i \\cdot n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6306em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5506em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 近似（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{m}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6306em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5506em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是客户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的平均单次贡献边际，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是购买次数）。这个近似的代价是把「客户买了什么」的信息全部丢掉——一个只买高毛利配件的客户和一个只买低价引流品的客户会被算成同一类，而定精度要求下这个损失是不可接受的。</p>\n<p><strong>变体三：按市场归一的历史 CLV。</strong> 跨境场景下，同一个客户的贡献要落到统一基准币种才能比较，折算口径与 <a href=\"clv-cross-border-adjust\">跨境多币种与获客成本调整</a> 保持一致（逐笔按发生日折算，展示层按期末重估）。</p>\n<p>三个变体的选择取决于数据可得性，但有一条硬规则：<strong>同一个模型的所有标签必须用同一个变体计算</strong>。混用会让模型学到「数据质量」而不是「客户价值」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测-clv-排序与定量是两种完全不同的任务\">预测 CLV：排序与定量是两种完全不同的任务</h2><p>预测 CLV 最常见的误解是「模型要预测得准」。但「准」在两种用法下含义不同，要求的模型能力也不同。</p>\n<p><strong>用法一：排序（ranking）。</strong> 目标是回答「A 和 B 谁更值钱」。这只需要模型保持单调性——把真正高价值的客户排在前面。此时绝对值的偏差完全无害：如果模型把每个人的 CLV 都系统性高估 30%，而层间相对关系正确，那么所有依赖「阈值」的策略全废、所有依赖「排序」的策略全对。做权益分层、投放人群圈选、客服优先级时，排序能力是唯一重要的东西。</p>\n<p><strong>用法二：定量（quantification）。</strong> 目标是回答「这个人未来一年会贡献 128 元还是 512 元」，因为它要进财务预算、要进获客出价的上限公式、要进 LTV/CAC 比值的分母。此时系统性偏差是致命的：高估 30% 会让公司按错误的天花板买量，直到现金流出问题才被发现。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>出价上限</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>CLV</mtext><mtext>pred</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>目标营销费率</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（定量用）</mtext><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>人群排序</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>argsort</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>CLV</mtext><mtext>pred</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（排序用）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{出价上限} = \\text{CLV}_{\\text{pred}} \\times \\text{目标营销费率} \\quad \\text{（定量用）} \\qquad \\text{人群排序} = \\text{argsort}(\\text{CLV}_{\\text{pred}}) \\quad \\text{（排序用）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">出价上限</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标营销费率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（定量用）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人群排序</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">argsort</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（排序用）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>区分二者有一个直接的工程后果：<strong>定量用法必须做概率校准（calibration）</strong>，把模型输出的 0.3 校准成真实频率 0.3；排序用法只需要保证判别能力（AUC、NDCG 类指标），但必须做分层单调性检查。一个 AUC 0.85 但严重高估的模型，对排序策略完全够用，对出价公式是灾难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不确定性-为什么点估计不该直接进决策\">不确定性：为什么点估计不该直接进决策</h2><p>预测 CLV 的本质是用有限历史推断未来，因此任何负责任的做法都必须给出分布的宽度。对客户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的预测 CLV，我们至少要知道它的后验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>CLV</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mtext>history</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\text{CLV}_i \\mid \\text{history}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">history</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，才能回答「这个估计值有多可信」。</p>\n<p>对决策而言，真正有用的是<strong>保守下界</strong>而非期望值。设目标营销费率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，那么安全的出价上限应当基于价值分布的某个分位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而不是均值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>bid</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>CLV</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mtext>history</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bid}_{\\max}(i) = q_{\\alpha}\\big( p(\\text{CLV}_i \\mid \\text{history}_i) \\big) \\cdot r, \\qquad \\alpha \\in [0.2, 0.4]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bid</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">history</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用分位数而不是均值，等于在模型不确定性大的客户身上自动收紧预算——历史极短的新客估计天然宽，出价自然低，这正是我们希望的保守行为。反之，一个只有点估计的系统，会在新客身上给出和五年老客一样自信的出价，这是新市场冷启动期最典型的过度投放来源。</p>\n<p>从实现上看，后验分布的两种常见来源是：概率模型直接给出的解析分布（见 <a href=\"clv-model-method\">BG/NBD、概率模型与 ML 预测</a>），以及 ML 模型通过分位数回归或 bootstrap 集成近似出来的经验分布。前者在稀疏数据下更可靠，后者在高维特征下更灵活。</p>\n<h2 id=\"观测窗口与标签构造-让历史成为可学习的样本\">观测窗口与标签构造：让历史成为可学习的样本</h2><p>预测 CLV 是监督学习任务，因此历史 CLV 必须被组织成 (特征, 标签) 对。跨境场景下这一步有一个必须显式设计的东西：<strong>观测窗口与表现窗口的划分</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  T0[首次购买 T0] --&gt; O1[观测窗口&lt;br/&gt;特征来源]&#10;  O1 --&gt; S[切分点 T_split]&#10;  S --&gt; P1[表现窗口&lt;br/&gt;标签来源]&#10;  P1 --&gt; T1[标签截断点 T_label]\">graph LR\n  T0[首次购买 T0] --&gt; O1[观测窗口&lt;br/&gt;特征来源]\n  O1 --&gt; S[切分点 T_split]\n  S --&gt; P1[表现窗口&lt;br/&gt;标签来源]\n  P1 --&gt; T1[标签截断点 T_label]</pre><p>规则有几条，缺一条就会引入系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>特征只能用切分点之前的数据</strong>。用切分点之后的浏览、加购、客服记录去预测切分点之后的价值，在线下能刷出极高的 AUC，上线后一无是处——这是时间穿越泄露，是 CLV 建模里出现频率最高的错误。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>标签窗口必须对所有样本一致</strong>。如果新客的标签窗口是 30 天、老客是 365 天，模型学到的第一个特征是「注册时长」。统一窗口的代价是老客的长期价值被截断，解决办法是让标签窗口足够长（跨境的季节性品类通常需要 365 天以覆盖完整消费周期），并接受样本新鲜度下降。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>表现窗口内必须排除首单</strong>（如果预测目标是从下一次开始的增量）或包含首单（如果预测目标是全生命周期），这个选择要在口径文档里写死。两种口径的数值差异可以到 40%，混淆会让所有跨季度比较失效。</p>\n<p>第四，<strong>按市场分别检查标签分布</strong>。同一个模型不可能同时适配「德国客户年均购买 8 次」与「印尼客户年均购买 1.2 次」的标签尺度，直接用全局模型会在低价值市场把所有人都归到同一层。处理方式是分层建模或把市场特征显式喂进模型，具体在 <a href=\"clv-model-method\">BG/NBD、概率模型与 ML 预测</a> 展开；需要构造跨币种、跨成本口径的统一标签时，按 <a href=\"clv-cross-border-adjust\">跨境多币种与获客成本调整</a> 的三层修正执行。</p>\n<p>预测 CLV 的输出还有一个不在本文展开但贯穿全 hub 的用途：它是 <a href=\"../lifecycle-stage/stage-definition\">新客/成长/成熟/衰退/流失划分</a> 中价值维度的来源，也是 <a href=\"../clv-resource-allocation/clv-based-acquisition\">按 CLV 定获客出价/预算</a> 的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：用收入代替贡献边际。</strong> GMV 是最容易拿到的数，也是最容易骗人的数。一个退货率 35% 的市场的客户，其真实贡献可能只有账面 GMV 的三分之一。所有 CLV 计算必须以净贡献为口径，退货与逆向物流成本要在公式内扣除。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：把 CLV 当绝对值而不是相对值。</strong> 「这个客户值 500 元」这句话在没有市场、品类、时间口径的情况下毫无意义。CLV 的绝大部分正确用法是相对比较——同一个市场内的人之间比，不同市场之间比时必须先把口径对齐（见 <a href=\"clv-cross-border-adjust\">跨境多币种与获客成本调整</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：忽略折现。</strong> 一个三年后贡献 1000 元的客户，和今天贡献 1000 元的客户，不是同一件事。按年折现率 10% 计算，前者只值约 751 元。做横向比较、做投资回收期判断时，折现不可省略；做短期出价时可以省略，但要在口径里说明。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱四：用历史 CLV 训练模型却用绝对阈值筛选。</strong> 如果模型是排序能力的（只保证单调），那么下游用「CLV &gt; 300 元」这样的绝对阈值筛人，等于把排序模型当定量模型用，阈值会随市场结构漂移。正确做法是改用分位数阈值（「排在前 10%」），它对绝对值偏差免疫。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CLV 是四个独立的量：历史（精确、可追溯）、累计收入（财务口径）、预测（模型依赖、带区间）、折现（用于横向比较）。混用是大部分误用的根源。</li>\n<li>历史 CLV 必须用贡献边际口径，含发货、退货、支付手续费；跨境场景下这三个成本的市场差异比商品毛利差异更大。</li>\n<li>预测 CLV 分排序与定量两种用法：排序只需单调性，定量必须概率校准。用错口径比模型不准更致命。</li>\n<li>决策应用分布的保守下界（如 20–40 分位）而非期望值，让不确定性大的新客自动获得保守出价。</li>\n<li>标签构造有三条硬规则：特征不得穿越切分点、标签窗口对所有样本一致、口径（是否含首单）写死并全局统一。</li>\n<li>折现在横向比较与回收期判断时不可省略；年折现率 10% 下，三年后的 1000 元现值约 751 元。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"历史 CLV 与预测 CLV","id":"历史-clv-与预测-clv"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：CLV 是四个不同问题的四个答案","id":"核心概念-clv-是四个不同问题的四个答案"},{"level":2,"text":"历史 CLV 的精确公式与三个变体","id":"历史-clv-的精确公式与三个变体"},{"level":2,"text":"预测 CLV：排序与定量是两种完全不同的任务","id":"预测-clv-排序与定量是两种完全不同的任务"},{"level":2,"text":"不确定性：为什么点估计不该直接进决策","id":"不确定性-为什么点估计不该直接进决策"},{"level":2,"text":"观测窗口与标签构造：让历史成为可学习的样本","id":"观测窗口与标签构造-让历史成为可学习的样本"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"BG/NBD、概率模型与 ML 预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/clv-modeling/clv-model-method"}}